	<h1>Getting started</h1>
	<norn-rich-text>
		<p>The layout puts a navigation column beside the page. The navigation stays in view as the page scrolls, and the columns stack when the frame is narrow.</p>
		<h2>Install</h2>
		<p>Prose styles come from <code>norn-rich-text</code>.</p>
	</norn-rich-text>
